1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
A problem we face when recording calls:

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,620
that recording announcement -

3
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:06,950
the person on the other side hears it.

4
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:10,950
So in today's video, I'll
tell you the fix for that.

5
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,300
For more useful videos like this,

6
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:15,000
subscribe to the channel now,

7
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:17,720
follow me and share the
video with everyone -

8
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:20,700
let people know this is possible.

9
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:23,400
Welcome to V Create!

10
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:25,900
Welcome, everyone, to a new video.

11
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:28,500
Let's see how to do it.

12
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:30,760
This one is for Android phone users -

13
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:34,080
I've already made a video for iPhone.

14
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:37,600
It's very simple to do;
I'll show you on my phone.

15
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:41,300
So, here's what to do:
open your phone dialer.

16
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,650
Once it opens, at the very top,

17
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:46,000
on the left, there are
three lines - a menu icon.

18
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:49,700
In other words, once it's open,
at the very top on the left

19
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:53,400
you'll see three lines - the menu icon.

20
00:00:53,610 --> 00:00:56,500
Tap it, then tap Settings.

21
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:59,600
In Settings, tap Call recording.

22
00:00:59,610 --> 00:01:01,950
Scroll down a little,

23
00:01:02,170 --> 00:01:04,600
and you'll see Play audio
tone instead of disclaimer -

24
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:06,600
a toggle button.

25
00:01:06,610 --> 00:01:07,900
Turn it on.

26
00:01:08,190 --> 00:01:12,200
In the window that opens, tap Agree,

27
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:14,300
and it's turned on.

28
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:18,500
Once it's on, from now on,
when you record calls -

29
00:01:18,590 --> 00:01:22,600
as I said earlier - without
the other person hearing

30
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:25,400
that announcement, you can record.

31
00:01:25,590 --> 00:01:27,700
A really simple, useful tip.

32
00:01:27,750 --> 00:01:31,950
So share it with everyone, let
people know this is possible.

33
00:01:32,090 --> 00:01:35,100
Anyway, see you again with a new topic!

